# --- Azzio File Manager (GTK) ----------------------------------------------
# file_manager is Azzio's OWN GTK file manager (packages/file_manager), the chosen file
# manager: a Qt file manager was tried first but customizing it meant fighting hardcoded C++
# strings, QRC templates and lockdowns. The GTK file manager is the better fit -- it matches the
# rest of the GTK desktop (gedit/gimp/xviewer + the Adwaita theme + the QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME=gtk3
# bridge), is minimal and stable, and its custom right-click actions (~/.config/Thunar/uca.xml,
# the on-disk path the binary reads) are a first-class feature that runs any command with
# mime/pattern conditions -- exactly what the "Create Link" and "Edit with gedit/gimp"
# requirements need. This is OUR package (pkgbuild.pkgbuild_file_manager), built from the vendored
# source. Configured by packages/file_manager.
file_manager
# tumbler: the thumbnail service the file manager calls to render image/video/PDF thumbnails in
# the icon view. Without it the file manager shows generic icons instead of previews.
tumbler
# zenity: GTK dialog helper. The "Create Link" custom action prompts for a name + target
# via zenity (GTK, fits the desktop better than kdialog). Also generally useful for
# shell-driven GUI prompts.
zenity
# exo: provides exo-open, the Xfce "preferred applications" launcher the file manager's default
# "Open Terminal Here" uses (`exo-open --launch TerminalEmulator`). Azzio points the
# preferred TerminalEmulator at kitty (packages/azzio/default_applications.py).
exo
# --- xviewer (the "Photos" default image viewer, GTK) ---------------------
# The XDG "Photos"/image default (Default Applications maps image/* to it). Ships with an
# off-putting "spying eye" icon that modifications/xviewer.py replaces with an Azzio icon.
xviewer
qalculate-gtk
