# GPU DRIVERS -- every vendor + developer/compute stacks (for `azzio gpu --resolve`)
# The ISO ships a generic stack (mesa, above) that works everywhere; these are baked in
# so `azzio gpu --resolve` installs the RIGHT vendor + developer drivers OFFLINE from the
# local repo. Outdated versions are the user's `pacman -Syu` problem, not this list's.
# ============================================================================
# Common (vendor-neutral loader, layers, VA-API/VDPAU bridge, dev tools)
# dkms + linux-headers let the NVIDIA *-dkms kernel modules build against the shipped kernel.
dkms
