# NVIDIA (open kernel module + CUDA). Arch's current driver series (6xx) ships ONLY the
# open module -- the proprietary/closed kernel module was discontinued upstream and is not
# in the repos (nvidia-dkms is now merely a Provides alias for nvidia-open-dkms), so there
# is no proprietary package to bake without the AUR. DKMS builds it against the kernel.
nvidia-open-dkms
nvidia-utils
lib32-nvidia-utils
nvidia-settings
cuda
opencl-nvidia
